    "fleiss_kappa_note": "Nominal kappa across all raters simultaneously -- does not credit near-misses (a 4-vs-5 disagreement counts the same as a 1-vs-5 one), so this is expected to read more conservative (lower) than the pairwise linear-weighted kappas above. Reported as a supplementary omnibus statistic, not the headline number.",
